# Local-reference-only docs -- not meant to be committed. SECURITY.md tracks unpatched gaps by
# design; ARCHITECTURE_REVIEW*.md/DECISIONS.md/INITIATIVES.md are working notes, not shipped
# documentation. The rest (ARCHITECTURE.md, CHANGELOG.md, ITEMS.md, MINIGAMES.md) joined this list
# because Plugin Hub's own token-count message only names "comments, resources, test sources, and
# the readme" as excluded -- a root-level docs/ folder doesn't fit any of those categories, so it
# likely counts toward the 200k limit. Intended destination is the repo's GitHub Wiki, which Hub's
# reviewer almost certainly never scans at all -- kept local for now until that move happens.
docs/
